## ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
## PopBlocks .gitignore  (.NET MAUI, Android only, Visual Studio)
## Commit source, project files and docs. Do not commit anything that a build, an IDE,
## a test run or a signing step can regenerate, and never commit secrets.
## ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

## ---- Build output --------------------------------------------------------
bin/
obj/
publish/
artifacts/

## ---- Visual Studio and other IDEs ----------------------------------------
.vs/
.vscode/
.idea/
*.user
*.suo
*.userosscache
*.sln.docstates
*.rsuser
*.DotSettings.user
_ReSharper*/
*.resharper.user
*.log

## ---- Tests and coverage --------------------------------------------------
TestResults/
*.trx
*.coverage
*.coveragexml
coverage*.json
coverage*.xml

## ---- NuGet ---------------------------------------------------------------
*.nupkg
*.snupkg

## ---- Android -------------------------------------------------------------
## Built packages: share them through a release page, not through git.
*.apk
*.aab
*.apks
## Signing material: NEVER commit. A leaked keystore lets someone publish updates as you.
*.keystore
*.jks
*.pfx
*.p12
*.snk
keystore.properties
signing.properties
## Machine-specific paths written by the Android tooling.
local.properties
## Crash and memory dumps from device tooling.
*.hprof
*.dmp

## ---- Secrets and local configuration --------------------------------------
## The game is offline and has no API keys, but this keeps one from slipping in later.
.env
.env.*
secrets.json
*.secrets.json

## ---- Operating system ----------------------------------------------------
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
Desktop.ini
$RECYCLE.BIN/
.DS_Store
.AppleDouble
*~
*.swp

## ---- Project specific ----------------------------------------------------
## Files parked for deletion; they are outside the solution and not part of the game.
_to_delete/
## Local scratch space.
scratch/
